        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The 2SLS estimate is 0.083 (SE 0.030; p<.01; N=4,175), using a preschool-offer lottery as the instrument. It measures enrollment within six months of projected high-school graduation, not degree completion.",
